      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A rat raised to be used as a test sample by a research organization. It escaped the facility, and thanks to its high reproductive rate its numbers are exploding. Having been used in an experiment to see what would happen to monsters continually exposed to magic power, it gained great physical ability and intelligence. On top of being able to sniff out traps, it is also resistant to poison. It is an incredibly wicked monster which holds great resentment towards the humans who subjected it to such cruel experiments.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 21, touch 17, flat-footed 15 (+5 dex, +1 dodge, +4 natural, +1 size)</p><p>hp 52 [77] (7d10+21)</p><p>Fort +8, Ref +10, Will +5</p><p>Immune disease and poison status effect;</p><p>Weakness Fire</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 40 ft., climb 20 ft., swim 20 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +10 (1d6+2 plus disease), 2 Claws +10 (1d4+2)</p><p>Special Attacks Bacteria, Critical Attack, Disease</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 15, Dex 20, Con 16, Int 2, Wis 16, Cha 4</p><p>Base Atk +7; CMB +8; CMD 23 (27 vs. trip)</p><p>Feats Dodge, Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Skill Focus (Perception)</p><p>Skills Climb +13, Perception +12, Stealth +18, Swim +13; Racial Modifiers use Dex to modify Climb and Swim</p><p><strong>GM note:</strong> CMD 23, 27 against trip. Disease and poison status immunity do not prevent poison-element damage.</p>"
      }
    },
